Package: rbioanp
Title: Access and Process Biodiversity Data from bioANP Peru
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Paul E.", "Santos Andrade", , 
    "paulefrens@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-6635-0375"))
Description: Provides tools for downloading, cleaning, and analyzing flora 
    and fauna inventories from the bioANP platform of the National System of 
    State-Protected Natural Areas (SINANPE) in Peru. It includes functions 
    for taxonomic name normalization, infraspecific rank classification, 
    and biodiversity data visualization.
